      "panels": [],
      "title": "Is each budget inside its allowance?",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Spend against allowance. 1.0 is at budget. Sustained overshoot means the allowance is undersized for the reads the fleet can't avoid \u2014 raise it rather than loosening a guard.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 101,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (budget) (rate(spacetraders_daemon_scan_budget_decisions_total{decision=\"spend\",player_id=\"$player\"}[$__rate_interval]))\n  / max by (budget) (spacetraders_daemon_scan_budget_rate_req_per_sec{player_id=\"$player\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{budget}}"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Budget utilisation (x allowance)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Watch the shape, not the number. The dashed lines mark 1x and 2x allowance. A step down means a fix landed; a flat line above 1 is structural and won't correct itself.",
